# .gcloudignore
#
# Cloud Run's `gcloud run deploy --source` uses .gcloudignore when present.
# Without it, Cloud Run derives the upload list from .gitignore, which
# would exclude data/ryde_samples/ (the sample dataset shared by Ryde
# with hackathon participants — git-ignored so we don't redistribute it,
# but needed on Cloud Run for the live demo).
#
# This file keeps everything .gitignore ignores, EXCEPT data/ryde_samples/.

# Re-include .gitignore patterns but exclude data/ryde_samples/ from the
# ignore list.
.gcloudignore
.git
.gitignore

.venv/
__pycache__/
.env
devlog/
runs/
.DS_Store
eval/results-*-mock.json

# data/ryde_samples/ is git-ignored (not redistributed) but MUST be
# uploaded to Cloud Run for the live demo.  Do NOT list it here.
